# -------------------------------
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/
**/storage/*.key
**/storage/pail
**/storage/app/public
**/storage/debugbar
**/storage/framework/cache/data
**/storage/logs
**/bootstrap/cache/
**/.gitattributes
**/.phpunit.result.cache
**/.phpunit.xml

# Laravel Mix (frontend build)
**/public/hot
**/public/build
**/public/storage
**/public/mix-manifest.json
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

